## Sequence diagram:

### Phase 1: Only with a secure browser

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
	participant C as Candidate
	participant TR as Client-System
	participant S as Surpass
	participant PI as Proview integration
	participant WP as Wrapper
	participant TP as Proview

	C ->> TR: Select Surpass test
	TR ->> TP: Get access token for authentication(TS1)
	C ->> TR: Select a time slot
	C ->> TR: Register for the exam
	TR ->> PI: Booking request(TS3)
	PI ->> S: Schedule test with upsert candidate
	S ->> PI: Get keycode and test URL
	PI ->> TP: Generate signed wrapper link
	PI ->> TR: Webhook to send back the signed wrapper link(TS4)
	TR ->> C: Share the signed link with the candidate
	C ->> C: Open the link sent
	C ->> WP: Launch the wrapper using the signed URL
	WP ->> WP: Completes pre-flight checks
	WP ->> WP: Passed on Surpass test link 
	WP ->> WP: Takes the test
	C ->> S: Completes the surpass test
	S -->> WP: Redirect for proctoring completion
	C -->> WP: Completes the proctored session using a button
	S ->> PI: Webhook triggered on test completion
	PI ->> S: Pulls results based on the test session created
	PI ->> TR: Webhook to push score back
```

