## Technical specification:

### TS1: To authenticate with Proview:

Below is the API to get the access token, which needs to be used to pass as an `Authorization` header in all other request headers. 

**Request Headers**:

| Header | Description |
| --- | --- |
| Host | https://auth.talview.com |
| Endpoint | /v1/user/login |
| HTTP method | POST |
| app-id | Will be shared by Talview |
| Content-Type | application/json |

**Request payload attributes definition:**

| attribute | type | mandatory | description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| username | string | true | API username shared by Talview |
| password | string | true | API password shared by Talview |

Sample request body:

```bash

{
	"username": "username",
	"password": "password"
}
```

**Sample CURL request**:

```bash
curl --request POST \
  --url https://auth.talview.com/v1/user/login \
  --header 'app-id: {{app_id}}' \
  --header 'content-type: application/json' \
  --data '{
		"username": "username",
		"password": "password"
	}'
```

---

- **Response:**
    - **Status Code: 200**
        
        ```bash
        {
        	"access_token": "<access_token>",
        	"refresh_token": "<refresh_token>",
        	"grant_type": "Bearer",
        	"expires_in": 10800
        }
        ```
        
    - **Possible Errors**
        
        ```bash
        {
          "name": "Not Found",
          "status": 404,
          "message": "The authentication request was unsuccessful"
        }
        {
        	"name": "Bad Request",
        	"status": 400,
        	"message": "string"
        }
        {
        	"name": "Unprocessable Entity",
        	"status": 422,
        	"message": "string"
        }
        ```
        

### TS2: To get available slots for a given date range:

Below is the API to get available slots for proctoring

**Request Headers**:

- Host:
    - Sandbox/staging: `https://integration-trinity.talview.org`
    - Production: `https://integration-trinity.talview.com`

| Header | Description |
| --- | --- |
| Host | Mentioned above |
| Endpoint | /booking/availability |
| HTTP method | GET |
| Content-Type | application/json |
| Authorization | Bearer <:access_token_from_TS_1:> |

**Query parameters definition:**

| attribute | type | mandatory | description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| start_time | string($date-time) | true | Start time of the slot (in UTC format) |
| end_time | string($date-time) | true | End time of the slot (in UTC format) |

**Sample CURL request**:

```bash
curl --request GET \
  --url 'https://integration-trinity.talview.org/booking/availability?start_time=2024-03-26T00%3A30%3A00.000Z&end_time=2024-03-26T10%3A30%3A00.000Z' \
  --header 'accept: application/json, text/plain, */*' \
  --header 'accept-language: en-IN,en-GB;q=0.9,en;q=0.8,en-US;q=0.7' \
  --header 'authority: delivery-nvidia-api.talview.org' \
  --header 'authorization: <<Bearer token>>' \
```

---

- **Response:**
    - **Status Code: 200**
        
        ```bash
        {
        	"slots": [
        		{
        			"event_name": "5-3-3pm",
        			"event_status": "scheduled",
        			"event_id": 33023,
        			"id": 98972,
        			"starts_at": "2024-03-05T10:30:00.000Z",
        			"ends_at": "2024-03-05T11:30:00.000Z",
        			"status": "scheduled",
        			"duration": "3600.000000",
        			"num_candidate": 0,
        			"bookings_available": 4
        		}
        	]
        }
        ```
        
    - **Possible Errors**
        
        ```bash
        {
        	"name": "Bad Request",
        	"status": 400,
        	"message": "string"
        }
        {
        	"name": "Unprocessable Entity",
        	"status": 422,
        	"message": "string"
        }
        ```
        
    
    <aside>
    💡 Note: [Slot.id](http://Slot.id) from this API’s response will have to be sent in the booking request as schedule.slot_id
    
    </aside>
    

### TS3: To book a session on Proview:

Below is the API to book a live proctored or secure browser session on Proview.

### Request Header:

- Host:
    - Sandbox/staging: `https://integration-trinity.talview.org`
    - Production: `https://integration-trinity.talview.com`

| Attribute | value |
| --- | --- |
| Host | Mentioned above |
| Endpoint | **/booking/create** |
| HTTP method | POST |
| Authorization | Bearer <:access_token> |
| app-id | Will be shared by Talview |
| Content-Type | application/json |

### **Request payload attributes definition:**

| Parameters | Phase | Type | Mandatory | Description |  |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| candidate | 1 | object | true | Candidate details |  |
| candidate/first_name | 1 | string | true | First name of the candidate |  |
| candidate/last_name | 1 | string | true | Last name of the candidate |  |
| candidate/middle_name | 1 | string | optional | Middle name of the candidate |  |
| candidate/email | 1 | string | optional | Email of the candidate |  |
| candidate/external_id | 1 | string | true | Trinity’s candidate ID can be sent to this field, which will be used as the Surpass candidate’s reference  |  |
| candidate/dob | 1 | date | true | Date of birth of the candidate. allowed Format: MM/DD/YYYY |  |
| proctoring | 2 | object | true | Proctoring details for scheduling live proctoring sessions on Proview |  |
| proctoring/enabled | 2 | boolean | true | Flag to enable or disable proctoring |  |
| proctoring/type | 2 | string | optional | Type of proctor session. value: `  or live_proctor |  |
| proctoring/slot_id | 2 | integer | optional | Slot selected by the candidate from the available slots API. Mandatory when `proctoring/type` is `live_proctor` |  |
| secure_browser | 1 | object | true | Secure browser configurations |  |
| secure_browser/enabled | 1 | boolean | true | Flag to enable/disable Secure browser for the flow |  |
| schedule | 1 | object | true | Schedule details of the booking request which will be used for Surpass test scheduling |  |
| schedule/start_date | 1 | string | true | Start date of the Surpass test. Format: DD/MM/YYYY |  |
| schedule/end_date | 1 | string | true | End date of Surpass test. Format: DD/MM/YYYY.  |  |
| schedule/start_time | 1 | string | true | Start time of the Surpass test. Format: HH:mm |  |
| schedule/end_time | 1 | string | true | End time of the Surpass test. Format: HH:mm |  |
| schedule/proctor_token | 1 | string | true | Proctor token that will be shared by Talview |  |
| test | 1 | object | true | Surpass test details |  |
| test/type | 1 | string | true | Type of test integration. Value: `surpass` |  |
| test/centre_id | 1 | integer | true | Surpass test center ID to schedule Surpass test  |  |
| test/test_id | 1 | integer | optional | Surpass test ID to schedule Surpass test |  |
| test/reference_id | 1 | string | true | Surpass test reference ID to schedule a Surpass test |  |
| test/subject_id | 1 | integer | optional | Surpass subject ID to schedule Surpass test |  |
| unlock_override | 1 | Object | optional | Overrides to applied for Surpass test. Ref `unlockOverride` object in the below API documentation
https://help.surpass.com/developer/surpass-api-v2/api-v2-reference/test-administration/testschedule-api/ |  |

