### TS4: Webhook for successful booking request:

The customer must provide an API that supports the HTTP post method, which will be triggered once a booking request is successful with the following payload.

```jsx
{
	"acknowledgement_id": "uuid",
  "exam_url": "https://tinyurl.com/28ky5lwh",
  "booking_status": "successful", //allowed values : [successfull,failed]
	"proctoring": {
		"enabled": "true",
		"type": "record_and_review"
	},
	"secure_browser": {
		"enabled": true
	},
	"errors": null , //will receive an error message if the booking request process is failed
  "test_schedule_response": {
    "id": 3768,
    "href": "https://trinityexams.surpass.com/api/v2/TestSchedule/3768",
    "errors": null,
    "keycode": "X3QPQ35M",
    "serverTimeZone": "GMT Standard Time",
    "candidate": {
      "id": 2960,
      "reference": "ref-from-trinity-100"
    }
  }
}
```

### TS5: Webhook for pushing back the proctoring or Surpass results:

The customer must provide an API that supports the HTTP post method, which will be triggered once proctoring or Surpass results are available. 

### **Request schema:**

| Attribute | Description |  |
| --- | --- | --- |
| acknowledgement_id | uuid generated as acknowledgement for booking session |  |
| secure_browser | secure_browser configuration passed when booking a session |  |
| proctoring_outcome | Proctoring session details and results |  |
| proctoring_outcome.session_uuid | Talview’s Proctoring session ID, can we used to generate embedded playback view(TS6). |  |
| proctoring_outcome.session_status | Status of the Procting session. 
1. Completed
2. Reviewed |  |
| proctoring_outcome.session_completed_at | The time when of session was marked as completed. 
Sample value: 2024-03-05T13:11Z
Format: ISO 8601 timestamp in UTC |  |
| proctoring_outcome.proctor_rating | Rating generated by system or updated by the proctors after review is complete. 
Possible values:
1. High
2. Medium
3. Low |  |
| proctoring_outcome.proctor_remarks | Predefined disposition selected by Proctor as part of Review.  |  |
| proctoring_outcome.terminated | Boolean value to know if session was terminated.  |  |
| proctoring_outcome.termination_reason | Reason provided when session is being terminated by the proctor.  |  |
| surpass_outcome | Results fetched by `/api/v2/Result/{id}` API.
API reference: [Link](https://help.surpass.com/developer/surpass-api-v2/api-v2-reference/test-administration/result-api/#2) |  |

