### TS6: To create a Proctoring session’s embedded playback view:

**Request Headers**:

| Header | Description |
| --- | --- |
| Host | [https://proctoring.talview.com](https://proctoring.talview.com/) |
| Endpoint | /v1/token/playback |
| HTTP method | POST |
| app-id | Will be shared by Talview |
| Content-Type | application/json |

**Request payload attributes definition:**

| attribute | type | mandatory | description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| proctor_token | string | true | Will be shared by Talview |
| session_uuid | string | true | Value of proctoring_outcome.session_uuid received from TS5 |

Sample request body:

```bash
{
	"proctor_token": "proctor_token",
	"session_uuid": "TS5.proctoring_outcome.session_uuid"
}
```

**Sample CURL request**:

```bash
curl --request POST \
  --url https://proctoring.talview.com/v1/token/playback \
  --header 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  --header 'app-id: <:app-id:>' \
  --data '{
		"proctor_token": "proctor_token",
		"session_uuid": "TS5.proctoring_outcome.session_uuid"
	}'
```

Sample response payload:

```jsx
{
	"token": "<:playback_token:>",
	"session_uuid": "TS5.proctoring_outcome.session_uuid",
	"valid_till": "2024-03-05T13:11:49.452Z"
}
```

The generated token should be included in the URL format [`https://console.eu.proview.io/embedded](https://console.eu.proview.io/embedded)[/<:TS5.proctoring_outcome.session_uuid>?token=<:playback_token:>](https://console.eu.proview.io/session/%3C:TS5.proctoring_outcome.session_uuid%3E?token=%3C:playback_token:%3E)` to access the authenticated proview playback session view. 

